<title>FINLAND: VALMET SAYS NOT IN TALKS WITH AGCO.</title>
<headline>VALMET SAYS NOT IN TALKS WITH AGCO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy said on Monday it was not in talks with Agco Corp of the United States and a media report naming Valmet in connection with Agco was based on a misunderstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;it is a misunderstanding,&quot; said Seija-Riitta Laakso, head of Valmet investor relations.</p>
<p>As reported by the Financial Times on Monday, Agco was in business with Valmet tractors, a former division of Valmet which now is part of Finnish state-owned heavy vehicles maker Sisu Oy, she said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
